 "Više lokacija u Beogradu": "Several venues in Belgrade",
 "Treće izdanje programa kolektiva Za slobodnu Palestinu. Nedelju dana izložbi, predavanja, muzike i razgovora, a na kraju bazar za pomoć narodu Palestine.": "The third edition of the programme by the collective Za slobodnu Palestinu (For a Free Palestine). A week of exhibitions, talks, music and conversations, ending with a bazaar to support the people of Palestine.",
 "Deo programa održava se u kafićima i barovima.": "Part of the programme takes place in cafés and bars.",
