 "Sumud · Muslimani Beograda": "Sumud · Belgrade Muslim Collective",
 "Halal restorani i prodavnice, džamije i mesdžidi, kulturni događaji i važni kontakti za muslimane u Beogradu.": "Halal restaurants and shops, mosques and masjids, cultural events and useful contacts for Muslims in Belgrade.",
 "Muslimani Beograda · halal restorani, džamije i događaji | Sumud": "Belgrade Muslim Collective · halal restaurants, mosques and events | Sumud",
 "Halal mesta, džamije, događaji i umrežavanje muslimana u Beogradu.": "Halal places, mosques, events and a network of Muslims in Belgrade.",
 "Česta pitanja": "Frequently asked questions",
 "Česta pitanja · muslimani u Beogradu | Sumud": "FAQ · Muslims in Belgrade | Sumud",
 "Gde jesti halal, gde je džamija, gde se klanja džuma i koje brojeve treba znati u Beogradu.": "Where to eat halal, where the mosques are, where Friday prayer is held and which numbers to know in Belgrade.",
 "Gde jesti halal u Beogradu?": "Where can I eat halal in Belgrade?",
 "Na sajtu je spisak halal restorana, kafića i prodavnica po opštinama. U centru su Restoran Hanan, Restoran Kultura, Meze, Pazarski specijaliteti i Gallo's, a u Zemunu i na Novom Beogradu Mama Sara. Kod svakog mesta piše odakle je podatak o halal statusu, a certifikat uvek proverite na licu mesta.": "The site lists halal restaurants, cafés and shops by municipality. In the centre there are Restoran Hanan, Restoran Kultura, Meze, Pazarski specijaliteti and Gallo's, and in Zemun and New Belgrade there is Mama Sara. Each place shows where its halal information comes from, and you should always check the certificate on site.",
 "Gde je džamija u Beogradu?": "Where is the mosque in Belgrade?",
 "Bajrakli džamija u Gospodar Jevremovoj 11 na Dorćolu je jedina sačuvana istorijska džamija u Beogradu. Pored nje, džemati i mesdžidi postoje na Zvezdari, Karaburmi, u Borči, Krnjači, Zemunu, Zemun Polju, Batajnici, na Ledinama, u Surčinu i Sremčici. Adrese i mape su u delu Džemati Beograda.": "The Bajrakli Mosque at Gospodar Jevremova 11 in Dorćol is the only surviving historic mosque in Belgrade. There are also communities and masjids in Zvezdara, Karaburma, Borča, Krnjača, Zemun, Zemun Polje, Batajnica, Ledine, Surčin and Sremčica. Addresses and maps are in the Mosques of Belgrade section.",
 "Gde se klanja džuma u Beogradu?": "Where is Friday prayer held in Belgrade?",
 "Džuma namaz se klanja u Bajrakli džamiji i u drugim džematima po gradu. Tačno vreme proverite u džematu koji vam je najbliži.": "Friday prayer is held at the Bajrakli Mosque and at other communities around the city. Check the exact time at the community closest to you.",
 "Gde kupiti halal meso u Beogradu?": "Where can I buy halal meat in Belgrade?",
 "Halal mesnica Meandri je u Jelisavete Načić 4 i Porečkoj 1. Suho meso i sir prodaje Jusuf na Kalenić pijaci, a arapske i turske namirnice imaju Arapski dućan u Zemunu i Belgrad Türk Marketi na Paliluli.": "The halal butcher Meandri is at Jelisavete Načić 4 and Porečka 1. Jusuf sells cured meat and cheese at Kalenić market, and Arabic and Turkish groceries are at Arapski dućan in Zemun and Belgrad Türk Marketi in Palilula.",
 "Kako da upoznam druge muslimane u Beogradu?": "How can I meet other Muslims in Belgrade?",
 "Sumud je neformalna mreža muslimana Beograda, bez institucije i kancelarije. Postoji ženski džemat na WhatsAppu i javna Facebook stranica, a na sajtu možete preporučiti majstore, lekare i preduzetnike iz zajednice.": "Sumud is an informal network of Belgrade Muslims, with no institution or office. There is a women's group on WhatsApp and a public Facebook page, and on the site you can recommend tradespeople, doctors and entrepreneurs from the community.",
 "Koje brojeve treba da znam kad tek dođem u Beograd?": "Which numbers should I know when I first arrive in Belgrade?",
 "Hitna pomoć je 194, policija 192, vatrogasci 193, a opšti broj za hitne slučajeve 112. Uprava za strance je u Omladinskih brigada 1 na Novom Beogradu, a Urgentni centar u Pasterovoj 2 radi 24 časa. Svi brojevi su u delu Koga zvati.": "Ambulance is 194, police 192, fire brigade 193, and the general emergency number is 112. The Foreigners' Office is at Omladinskih brigada 1 in New Belgrade, and the Emergency Centre at Pasterova 2 is open 24 hours. All numbers are in the Who to call section.",
 "Kako da predložim mesto ili događaj?": "How can I suggest a place or an event?",
 "Pišite nam preko forme Javi nam se na dnu sajta ili na muslimanibeograda@proton.me. Za događaje postoji dugme Predloži događaj.": "Write to us through the Contact us form at the bottom of the site or at muslimanibeograda@proton.me. For events there is a Suggest an event button.",
 "Ko stoji iza sajta?": "Who is behind the site?",
 "Sajt pravi Sumud, neformalna grupa muslimana Beograda. Nismo deo nijedne verske ili državne institucije.": "The site is made by Sumud, an informal group of Belgrade Muslims. We are not part of any religious or state institution.",
